  "description": "greenR is an R package that enables the quantification, analysis, and visualization of urban greenness within city networks. It leverages data from OpenStreetMap (www.openstreetmap.org) and is implemented as both an R package and a Shiny web application for user-friendly interaction.",
  "description_ja": "greenRは都市ネットワーク内の緑豊かさを定量化・分析・可視化するRパッケージです。OpenStreetMap（www.openstreetmap.org）のデータを活用し、RパッケージおよびShiny Webアプリケーションとして実装されています",
  "url": "https://github.com/sachit27/greenR",
